SUMMARY:IASP 34th World Congress 2027
DESCRIPTION:The 34th IASP World Congress takes place in Colombo\, Sri Lan
 ka from 7 to 11 June 2027. Abstract submission and bursary applications 
 are open\; there will be no on site registration.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract
  submission opens: 2026-05-27\nSymposium and workshop abstract submissio
 n: 2026-10-01\nOral and poster abstract submission: 2026-10-15\nEarly re
 gistration opens: 2026-10-15\nEarly registration: 2027-02-18\nGeneral re
 gistration closes: 2027-06-04\n\nhttps://www.iasp.info/colombo2027/
LOCATION:Colombo\, Western Province\, LK\, Bandaranaike Memorial Internat
 ional Conference Hall (BMICH)
URL:https://www.iasp.info/colombo2027/
